		{
			description: [
				"&bApplied Energistics 2&r 是一款强大的&6大规模存储&r模组，为玩家提供&d基于网络的存储系统&r，可在&9高效的设备网络中&r存储、制作和管理&a物品&r与&c流体&r。"
				""
				"&3Items&r and &5fluids&r can be stored in one of the various &estorage cells&r the mod offers. All &cstorage devices&r connected to the same network are accessible through a &dsophisticated ME Terminal&r, allowing players to &amanage inventories&r, automate tasks, and process materials using a single unified &9GUI&r."
			]
			id: "0AA72D6706542CA6"
			rewards: [{
				count: 2
				id: "3B86DC10BC1841EB"
				item: "havencurrency:nova_coin_2"
