		{
			dependencies: ["4C57DF99E9A0BF6A"]
			description: [
				"虽然 &bInscriber&r 和 &bCharger&r 原生支持 &cRF/FE&r，但绝大多数 &dME Network&r 都使用名为 &dAE&r 的专用电力系统。"
				""
				"&cRF/FE&r can be converted into the native &dAE&r at a ratio of &62:1 RF:AE&r, either directly through an &bME Controller&r, or through the &bEnergy Acceptor&r, which can be connected to any part of the network."
